{
  "uid": "shopsense-agents",
  "title": "ShopSense / Agents and LLM",
  "description": "Behaviour of the multi-agent graph: step latency, supervisor decisions, Gemini calls and tool calls.",
  "tags": [
    "shopsense"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "10s",
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "time": {
    "from": "now-30m",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "editable": true,
  "templating": {
    "list": []
  },
  "links": [
    {
      "type": "dashboards",
      "tags": [
        "shopsense"
      ],
      "asDropdown": true,
      "title": "ShopSense dashboards",
      "includeVars": false,
      "keepTime": true
    }
  ],
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "How to read this dashboard",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 4
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**The AI side of the system.** *Agent steps* are the nodes of the LangGraph (supervisor, order agent, policy agent, writer). *Gemini calls* are the model requests those steps make. *Tool calls* are the functions an agent asks us to run.\n\nWatch three things: **how long steps take** (almost all of it is waiting for Gemini), **how often the guardrail has to override the supervisor** (a sign the prompt needs work), and **whether tools and model calls fail**. This dashboard shows *how the system behaves*. Whether the answers are *good* is a different question: that is what LangSmith (Phase 6) is for."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Gemini calls per minute",
      "description": "",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate(llm_calls_total[$__rate_interval])) * 60",
          "legendFormat": ""
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "blue",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "decimals": 1
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "textMode": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Gemini error ratio",
      "description": "Calls that raised an error: bad API key, quota exceeded, network trouble. Alert: LLMCallErrors (above 10%).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 6,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "((sum(rate(llm_calls_total{outcome=\"error\"}[$__rate_interval]))) or (sum(rate(llm_calls_total[$__rate_interval]))) * 0) / (sum(rate(llm_calls_total[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": ""
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 0.02
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0.1
              }
            ]
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "decimals": 2
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "textMode": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Guardrail override ratio",
      "description": "How often our code had to overrule the LLM supervisor. Rising = the supervisor prompt is getting worse or the model changed.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "((sum(rate(supervisor_decisions_total{guardrail_override=\"true\"}[$__rate_interval]))) or (sum(rate(supervisor_decisions_total[$__rate_interval]))) * 0) / (sum(rate(supervisor_decisions_total[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": ""
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 0.1
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0.2
              }
            ]
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "decimals": 1
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "textMode": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Tool error ratio",
      "description": "Tool calls that failed (e.g. orders unreachable). A 'not_found' answer is a normal outcome and is NOT counted here.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 18,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "((sum(rate(agent_tool_calls_total{outcome=\"error\"}[$__rate_interval]))) or (sum(rate(agent_tool_calls_total[$__rate_interval]))) * 0) / (sum(rate(agent_tool_calls_total[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": ""
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 0.01
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0.2
              }
            ]
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "decimals": 1
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "textMode": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Agent step p95 latency, by step (click an exemplar dot to open its trace)",
      "description": "",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 9
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (node, le) (rate(agent_node_duration_seconds_bucket[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{node}}",
          "exemplar": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Agent step average latency, by step",
      "description": "The supervisor runs several times per question, so its total time is (average x runs).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
